  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kenya Anti-corruption Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme seeks to strengthen accountability through partnership and evidence to prevent corruption in the public  and private sector. It seeks to enhance  demand-driven and bottom-up  engagement in the policy making  and oversight in public service delivery including developing tools and levers that can lead to improved ease of doing business and strengthen frameworks on asset recovery from proceeds of crime domestically and overseas.</narrative>
  </description>
